flowchart TD
  A([Open app]) --> B{Signed in?}
  B -- no --> L[Sign in / Register]
  L -->|wrong password| L
  L -->|success| Q
  B -- yes --> Q[Mood quiz: 4 questions]
  Q --> S[Familiar vs new slider]
  S --> P[Playlist with matched moods]
  P --> R[Rate mood fit 1-5]
  P --> T[Track page: facts, genres, player]
  T --> H[I listened: save to history]
  H --> F[Feed: filter, search, sort]
  P --> Hist[Playlists history]
  F --> Pr[Profile: consent, delete data]
